abstract: >-
  Paper sources, a dependency-free PHP library that reads the embedded ICC
  profile of a JPEG, PNG or WebP file and measures the colour shift when the
  profile is ignored (ΔE76 in CIELAB), a polite crawler that measures product
  images over live stores through their public catalogues, a WebP quality
  calibration script, a synthetic Display P3 profile for validation, and the
  data of the October 2026 crawl of 26 stores.
